title HUNK29 — the whole filter family joins the edit-list: hue, blur, sharpen, auto-levels, edges
prompt Continue the recursion loop past HUNK28: take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve the design round, send each finished increment as its own signed round, stop at custody gates.
think HUNK28 seated the first filter (saturate) into the non-destructive edit-list and proved the pattern: a filter recorded as an edit inherits undo/redo, cold-restart persistence, and travel-as-text for free. It named the rest of the family as next intent. This rung finishes the vocabulary.
think Read Lindy-first crux-first: this is one cohesive keystone (complete the grammar), not five scattered ones, because each verb is the identical additive shape HUNK28 proved, and the value — a fully recordable, replayable, travelling edit history — arrives only when the last verb joins. So hue_turn, blur, sharpen, stretch, edges all join in one round.
think Two field shapes cover the family, both already proven: hue_turn takes one u32 thirds (like rotate's turns); blur/sharpen/stretch/edges are nullary (like flip_h). No new field kind, no new error. Grew EditKind, Edit, apply, render_edits, parse_edits by five variants each.
obs One care caught: the selftest used "sharpen 3" as its unknown-verb refusal case — once sharpen is a real nullary verb, that line would refuse as an extra field instead. Moved the test to a genuinely-unknown tag (vignette) so the unknown-verb path stays honestly proven.
obs Selftest proves composition byte-for-byte (hue_turn then blur equals the two verbs by hand), and a list carrying EVERY verb kind — the complete filter family now — renders, parses back, and applies to the same bytes. The edit-list is now the one home for every Photos gesture; no edit is a wound.
obs No regression: all six downstream edit-list witnesses re-run GREEN (edit_cursor, edit_store, edit_preview, cursor_preview, session_store, session_list). Self-approved design round, no gate. No breach, no cairn — purely additive grammar variants. No network/key/funds — hardware buys stay custody gates #2/#3.
